Package: SUNLouvainPath
Type: Package
Title: Enumerate Deterministic Louvain Partitions on Seurat Graphs
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Junbo", "Wang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "99457639+SYSUWangJunbo@users.noreply.github.com",
           comment = "王俊博"),
    person("Jianyou", "Liao", role = "aut", comment = "廖建友"),
    person("GPT-6.2 Astra", role = "ctb", comment = "Development assistance"))
Description: Follows exact comparisons in a deterministic multilevel Louvain
    algorithm across the requested nonnegative resolution range. Searches
    disjoint intervals in parallel and stores distinct partitions
    and their resolution intervals in a Seurat object's tools slot. Ranks the
    final partitions by classical Newman-Girvan modularity and reports
    the earliest resolution attaining its maximum when a minimum exists.
